      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Closing speed = 6 km/hr, so B catches A in 2 hours.\n\nB's distance to catch point = 10 × 2 = 20 km.\nA has travelled 5 hours × 4 = 20 km too.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
